{#
mail/_agent_forward_sent.stream.html.twig
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
A hand-off to an agent, on its way: the toast a send from the composer gets,
naming who it went to, with the same Undo for the same cancel window. Undo
reopens the forward in the compose dock.

When an attachment could not be copied nothing was sent, and the toast says
the forward is waiting in Drafts instead.

Variables: agent (ForwardAgent), sent (bool), undoUrl, cancelWindow
#}
<turbo-stream action="append" target="toast-region">
    <template>
        {% if sent %}
            {% include '_partials/_toast.html.twig' with {
                type:    'success',
                message: 'agent_forward.sending'|trans({ '%name%': agent.name }),
                extra:   {
                    undo_url:   undoUrl,
                    hide_after: cancelWindow,
                },
            } only %}
        {% else %}
            {% include '_partials/_toast.html.twig' with {
                type:    'error',
                message: 'agent_forward.incomplete'|trans,
            } only %}
        {% endif %}
    </template>
</turbo-stream>
